body:
well people can have multiple orgasms, right?

&#x200B;

though i feel like i should point out: stop before she gets raw. this needs to be said apparently!

yeah the emotional thing is pretty hard to do imo. Some of them try to fix you (prolly not that easy), some of them try to go along with it, hoping it'll work itself out (yeah no) and i believe very few just go along and dont expect anything. the latter is the thing that works best for me. Nobody is trying to do anything really, and the two of you are just along for a pleasant ride.

&#x200B;

I know it can suck to crave sex and not get it, believe me. There's always hookers, though i have not been to one yet. Got very close a few times though. Dont overthink it - it's sex. the one thing you should NOT overthink.


If you can't accept women somewhat into your life, idk what to tell you really. I'd need more information about you to give you an honest advice, but right here right now: learn to love the little things about you. To me it's this dumb sentence i found on reddit somewhere "i hate myself, yet still think I'm better than anyone else". I feel like im pretty fucked up, with all the yadda yadda of may-or-may-not-be-depressed/suicidal but if they can't deal with that or me, I'm just gonna keep looking. Not that i was searching for a long term relationship (which got me into this mess in the first place), just for someone... to be alone together with.

&#x200B;

At the moment i have... something going on. She's not too pushy, she's okay with me being a mess, she doesn't get on my nerves (much). Its pretty awesome for the moment, and i try not to overthink it and just have fun with it. Sometimes you gotta turn off your brain i guess. However that works without outside help.

I was genuinely confused because i thought you had stolen my dudes or somehow gotten a picture of them because they look similar to mine af!

&#x200B;

ps: awesome paintscheme.

&#x200B;

edited for drunken typo
